 temalar\u0131 kald\u0131rmay\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn."],"The ZIP archive is invalid. Try to unpack and pack it again. If this problem persists, please contact support.":["ZIP ar\u015fivi ge\u00e7ersiz. Paketinizi a\u00e7\u0131p tekrar paketlemeyi deneyin. Sorun devam ederse l\u00fctfen destek ekibiyle ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in."],"%1$s Preview %2$d":["\u00d6nizleme: %1$s %2$d"],"Deleting preview sites requires an internet connection.":["\u00d6nizleme sitelerini silmek i\u00e7in internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 gerekir."],"Missing permissions":["Eksik izinler"],"Authentication error":["Kimlik do\u011frulama hatas\u0131"],"Actions":["\u0130\u015flemler"],"Expires":["Son Ge\u00e7erlilik Tarihi"],"Updated":["G\u00fcncelleme"],"Preview site":["\u00d6nizleme sitesi"],"Updating":["G\u00fcncelleniyor"],"Deleting preview site":["\u00d6nizleme sitesi siliniyor"],"%s ago":["%s \u00f6nce"],"Rename":["Yeniden adland\u0131r"],"Preview actions":["\u00d6nizleme i\u015flemleri"],"Your previews files and database along with all posts, pages, comments and media will be lost.":["T\u00fcm g\u00f6nderileri, sayfalar\u0131, yorumlar\u0131 ve ortamlar\u0131 i\u00e7eren \u00f6nizleme dosyalar\u0131n\u0131z ve veritaban\u0131 kaybedilir."],"Delete preview":["\u00d6nizleme sil"],"Updating will replace the existing files and database with a copy from your local site. Any changes you've made to your preview site will be permanently lost.":["G\u00fcncellendi\u011finde mevcut dosyalar ve veritaban\u0131, yerel sitenizdeki bir kopyayla de\u011fi\u015ftirilir. \u00d6nizleme sitenizde yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z t\u00fcm de\u011fi\u015fiklikler kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak kaybolur."],"Overwrite preview":["\u00d6nizlemenin \u00fczerine yaz"],"You've used %s preview sites available on your account.":["Hesab\u0131n\u0131zdaki kullan\u0131labilir %s \u00f6nizleme sitesini kulland\u0131n\u0131z.","Hesab\u0131n\u0131zdaki kullan\u0131labilir t\u00fcm %s \u00f6nizleme sitesini kulland\u0131n\u0131z."],"A different preview site is being created. Please wait for it to finish before creating another.":["Farkl\u0131 bir \u00f6nizleme sitesi olu\u015fturuluyor. L\u00fctfen ba\u015fka bir demo site olu\u015fturmadan \u00f6nce tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131 bekleyin."],"Studio is unable to open your default browser. Please ensure it is functioning correctly.":["Studio, varsay\u0131lan taray\u0131c\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 a\u00e7amad\u0131. L\u00fctfen do\u011fru \u015fekilde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emin olun."],"Failed to open browser":["Taray\u0131c\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131lamad\u0131"],"Studio is unable to open PHPStorm. Please ensure it is functioning correctly.":["Studio, PHPStorm'u a\u00e7amad\u0131. L\u00fctfen do\u011fru \u015fekilde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emin olun."],"Failed to open PHP Storm":["PHP Storm a\u00e7\u0131lamad\u0131"],"Studio is unable to open VS Code. Please ensure it is functioning correctly.":["Studio, VS Code'u a\u00e7amad\u0131. L\u00fctfen do\u011fru \u015fekilde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emin olun."],"Failed to open VS Code":["VS Code a\u00e7\u0131lamad\u0131"],"Updating preview site failed":["\u00d6nizleme sitesi g\u00fcncellenemedi"],"Cancelled":["\u0130ptal Edildi"],"Initializing backup\u2026":["Yedekleme ba\u015flat\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026"],"Error when executing wp-cli command":["Wp-cli komutu y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fcl\u00fcrken hata olu\u015ftu"],"Failed to check backup file size. Please try again.":["Yedek dosya boyutu kontrol edilemedi. L\u00fctfen tekrar deneyin."],"Your site's backup exceeds %s GB. Pulling it will prevent you from pushing the site back.\n\nDo you want to continue?":["Sitenizin yedeklemesi %s GB'\u0131 a\u015f\u0131yor. Bunu almak siteyi geri g\u00f6ndermenizi \u00f6nler.\n\nDevam etmek istiyor musunuz?"],"Large site's backup":["B\u00fcy\u00fck sitenin yedeklemesi"],"All preview sites that exist for your WordPress.com account, along with all posts, pages, comments, and media, will be lost.":["T\u00fcm g\u00f6nderiler, sayfalar, yorumlar ve ortamlarla beraber WordPress.com hesab\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in mevcut olan t\u00fcm \u00f6nizleme siteleri kaybolacak."],"All preview sites have been deleted.":["T\u00fcm \u00f6nizleme siteleri silindi."],"Delete all preview sites":["T\u00fcm \u00f6nizleme sitelerini sil"],"%1s of %2s active preview sites":["%1s\/%2s etkin \u00f6nizleme sitesi"],"Preview sites are not available for your account.":["\u00d6nizleme siteleri hesab\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in mevcut de\u011fil."],"Preview sites":["\u00d6nizleme siteleri"],"Powered by <a> WordPress.com<\/a>.":["<a>WordPress.com <\/a> taraf\u0131ndan desteklenmektedir."],"Preview sites expire 7 days after the last update.":["\u00d6nizleme sitelerin s\u00fcresi son g\u00fcncellemeden 7 g\u00fcn sonra sona erer."],"Create up to %d preview sites for free.":["\u00dccretsiz olarak %d adete kadar \u00f6nizleme sitesi olu\u015fturun."],"Get feedback from anyone, anywhere with a free hosted preview of your Studio site.":["Studio sitenizin \u00fccretsiz bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131lan bir \u00f6nizlemesiyle herkesten her yerde geri bildirim al\u0131n."],"Share a preview of your Studio site":["Studio sitenizin bir \u00f6nizlemesini payla\u015f\u0131n"],"Select an empty directory or a directory with an existing WordPress site. <button>Learn more<\/button>":["Bo\u015f dizin veya mevcut bir WordPress sitesi olan bir dizin se\u00e7in. <button>Daha fazla bilgi edinin<\/button>"],"Open Studio Logs":["Studio Kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7"],"A timeout error occurred while pushing the site, likely due to its large size. Please try reducing the site's content or files and try again. If this problem persists, please contact support.":["Site g\u00f6nderilirken zaman a\u015f\u0131m\u0131 hatas\u0131 oldu. Bunun nedeni sitenin b\u00fcy\u00fck olmas\u0131 olabilir. L\u00fctfen sitenin i\u00e7eriklerini veya dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131p yeniden deneyin. Sorun devam ederse l\u00fctfen destek ekibiyle ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in."],"Import a Jetpack backup or a full-site backup in another format. <button>Learn more<\/button>":["Bir Jetpack yedeklemesini veya ba\u015fka bir bi\u00e7imdeki tam site yedeklemesini i\u00e7e aktar\u0131n. <button>Daha fazla bilgi edinin<\/button>"],"Import a Jetpack backup, a full-site backup in another format, or a .sql database file. <button>Learn more<\/button>":["Bir Jetpack yedeklemesini, ba\u015fka bir bi\u00e7imdeki tam site yedeklemesini veya bir .sql veritaban\u0131 dosyas\u0131n\u0131 i\u00e7e aktar\u0131n. <button>Daha fazla bilgi edinin<\/button>"],"An error occurred while pushing the site. If this problem persists, please contact support.":["Site g\u00f6nderilirken hata olu\u015ftu. Sorun devam ederse l\u00fctfen destek ekibiyle ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in."],"Create a new WordPress.com site":["Yeni bir WordPress.com sitesi olu\u015ftur"],"Creating a preview site requires an internet connection.":["\u00d6nizleme sitesi olu\u015fturmak i\u00e7in internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 gerekir."],"No, take me back":["Hay\u0131r, beni geri g\u00f6t\u00fcr"],"Yes, quit the app":["Evet, uygulamadan \u00e7\u0131k"],"There\u2019s a sync operation in progress. Quitting the app will abort that operation. Are you sure you want to quit?":["Devam eden bir senkronizasyon i\u015flemi var. Uygulamadan \u00e7\u0131kmak bu i\u015flemin iptal edilmesine neden olacakt\u0131r. \u00c7\u0131kmak istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?"],"Sync in progress":["Senkronizasyon devam ediyor"],"Another Studio site is syncing. Please wait for the sync to finish before you push this site.":["Ba\u015fka bir Studio sitesi senkronize ediliyor. Bu siteyi g\u00f6ndermeden \u00f6nce l\u00fctfen senkronizasyonun tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131 bekleyin."],"This Studio site is syncing. Please wait for the sync to finish before you push it.":["Bu Studio sitesi senkronize ediliyor. G\u00f6ndermeden \u00f6nce l\u00fctfen senkronizasyonun tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0