131l daha h\u0131zl\u0131 yapabilirim?"],"The configuration couldn't be changed to speed up site creation.\n\nTo initiate this process again, please go to \"Help > How can I make Studio faster?\" in the application menu.":["Site olu\u015fturmay\u0131 h\u0131zland\u0131rmak i\u00e7in yap\u0131land\u0131rma de\u011fi\u015ftirilemedi.\n\nBu i\u015flemi yeniden ba\u015flatmak i\u00e7in l\u00fctfen uygulama men\u00fcs\u00fcnde \"Yard\u0131m > Studio'yu nas\u0131l daha h\u0131zl\u0131 yapabilirim?\" b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcne gidin."],"Microsoft Defender's Real-time protection may slow site creation.\n\nTo create sites quickly, we recommend disabling Real-time protection for the Studio app.":["Microsoft Defender'\u0131n Ger\u00e7ek zamanl\u0131 korumas\u0131 site olu\u015fturmay\u0131 yava\u015flatabilir.\n\nH\u0131zla siteler olu\u015fturmak i\u00e7in Studio uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7in Ger\u00e7ek zamanl\u0131 korumay\u0131 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rakman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz."],"Want to speed up site creation?":["Site olu\u015fturmay\u0131 h\u0131zland\u0131rmak m\u0131 istiyorsunuz?"],"I'm not interested.":["\u0130lgilenmiyorum."],"Sounds good, do it for me.":["Kula\u011fa iyi geliyor, benim yerime yap."],"Copy":["Kopyala"],"Error":["Hata"],"Success":["Ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131"],"Local sites powered by":["\u015eunun taraf\u0131ndan desteklenen yerel siteler"],"Share Feedback":["G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015flerinizi Payla\u015f\u0131n"],"Studio by WordPress.com":["Studio by WordPress.com"],"Version %s":["S\u00fcr\u00fcm %s"],"Propose a Feature":["Bir \u00d6zellik \u00d6nerin"],"Report an Issue":["Bir sorun bildirin"],"%1s of %2s monthly prompts used":["%1s\/%2s ayl\u0131k istem kullan\u0131ld\u0131"],"AI assistant":["Yapay Zeka asistan\u0131"],"Every account gets %d prompts included for free each month.":["Her hesaba her ay \u00fccretsiz olarak %d istem dahildir."],"If you don't have an account yet, <a>create one for free<\/a>.":["Hen\u00fcz bir hesab\u0131n\u0131z yoksa